menu "InkOS development-only test harnesses"

config INKOS_RSS_SERIAL_HARNESS
    bool "Enable the one-shot USB-local RSS navigation harness"
    default n
    help
        Development and acceptance testing only. Installs a guarded
        USB-Serial/JTAG command receiver that can execute one fixed RSS
        navigation scenario per boot through the production navigation and
        display paths. It does not add a network endpoint and is disabled in
        normal production builds.

endmenu
